{"text": "My own garden is my own garden, said the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will let nobody play in it but myself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he built a high wall all around it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he put up a sign that said TRESPASSERS WILL BE PROSECUTED. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a very selfish Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now the poor children had nowhere to play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They tried to play on the road, but it was dusty and stony. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How happy we were there, they said to each other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the Spring came, and there were little flowers and birds everywhere. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only in the garden of the Selfish Giant, it was still winter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The birds did not sing there, and the trees forgot to blossom.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "y", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", " ", "i", "s", " ", "m", "y", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "G", "i", "a", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "n", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", " ", "i", "n", " ", "i", "t", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "m", "y", "s", "e", "l", "f", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", " ", "h", "e", " ", "b", "u", "i", "l", "t", " ", "a", " ", "h", "i", "g", "h", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "a", " ", "s", "i", "g", "n", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "T", "R", 